{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "77ca67f9-d9c4-81e9-bc9c-a4c7d8716962",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T13:07:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:05:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Lorraine, Carlos Spencer here. So I'm just getting back to the shop after lunch, and I'm on a brand new phone, which, I'm still learning the swipe gestures, I keep closing things I don't mean to close. Hang on, I'm on the right screen now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, Mr. Spencer. I'm here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, the reason I'm calling. My Christmas tree is still sitting out by the curb. It's been there since the first week of January and nobody's taken it. I wanted to know if there's a Christmas tree pickup still, or if that's over and I'm supposed to do something else with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:05:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the tree has been out at the curb since early January and it hasn't been picked up. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's right. It's got no decorations, no stand, no bag on it. Just the tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:05:55-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that's how it should be. The holiday tree collection is usually a limited window in January, so by now it may have ended. I don't have the exact schedule in front of me, and I'd rather have someone who handles collection tell you what to do with it now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:06:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that works. Can I get a supervisor to call me back about it? I'd just like a straight answer on whether it gets picked up or if I have to haul it somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:06:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in that request. Let me get your number. Is the best one the cell you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:06:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-three. And that's Carlos Spencer, S-P-E-N-C-E-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Carlos, with a C."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll note that it's about a Christmas tree left at your curb since early January, and you'd like a supervisor to call you back with what to do. Is there a time that's better for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:06:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons are best. I'm at the shop till about five, so anytime in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons until five. I'll pass that along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thanks, Lorraine. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:07:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Spencer. Someone will be in touch. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
